#. module: om_dynamic_reports
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_om_dynamic_reports
msgid ""
"Dynamic accounting reports on screen for Odoo 20 Community: Executive "
"Summary, Balance Sheet, Profit and Loss, Cash Flow, Tax Report, Trial "
"Balance, General Ledger, Day Book, Bank Book, Cash Book, Journals Audit, "
"Partner Ledger, Aged Receivable, Aged Payable, Analytic Report, with "
"comparison, filters, drill-down to journal items, saved views and export to "
"PDF and Excel"
msgstr ""
"Resoconti contabili dinamici a schermo per Odoo 20 Community: riepilogo "
"direzionale, stato patrimoniale, conto economico, rendiconto finanziario, "
"resoconto imposte, bilancio di verifica, libro mastro, libro giornale, libro"
" banca, libro cassa, revisione registri, partitario clienti/fornitori, "
"scadenzario crediti, scadenzario debiti, resoconto analitico, con confronto,"
" filtri, drill-down fino ai movimenti contabili, viste salvate ed "
"esportazione in PDF ed Excel"

#. module: om_dynamic_reports
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_dynamic_reports
msgid ""
"Dynamic financial reports: the report on screen with its filters at the top,"
" accounts and partners that unfold into their journal items, drill-down, "
"saved views, and export to PDF, Excel and CSV as shown."
msgstr ""
"Resoconti finanziari dinamici: il resoconto a schermo con i filtri in alto, "
"conti e partner che si espandono nei loro movimenti contabili, drill-down, "
"viste salvate ed esportazione in PDF, Excel e CSV così come visualizzato."

